e=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">차수마다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">과목까지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">신청가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 18.6667px; text-indent: -19.7333px;\">&nbsp;·</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">신청경로&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">수강신청 배너&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">→ 수강신청(학부)</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">→&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">수강변경및정정신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=